# Testing Standards

Use pytest.

Write tests for:

- new features
- bug fixes
- regressions

---

## Test Structure

Arrange

Act

Assert

---

## Mocking

Mock external systems only.

Avoid mocking business logic.

---

## Coverage

Test:

- happy paths
- validation
- failures
- exceptions
- corner cases
---

## Naming

```
test_<feature>.py
```

Function names should describe behavior.

---

## Fixtures

Prefer reusable fixtures.

Avoid duplicated setup.